ame in fact they called it  Montauk right up until the airdate so  how did they arrive at stranger things  apparently it was the only other name  the creators could stomach the creative  staff at Netflix made a list of  alternative titles before they decided  on Stranger thing  said that Zephyr hated all the names on  that list he said that he hopes the list  of alternate titles never ever comes out  on the Internet he told everyone that if  they leaked the list he will hurt them  casting in the beginning there was a  question of whether to hire kid actors  who had some experience or just do an  open call to all kids regardless of  their acting experience they ultimately  decided to stick with kids who had  acting chops and had performed  professionally before even with that  filter on the casting process they saw  over 2,000 kids internationally for the  major kids roles open several of the  actors had been on Broadway before  namely Jaden matarazzo who had performed  in Priscilla Queen of the desert and  they miserably we found a video of him  singing bring him home from lei Missouri  blah and he really does have a gorgeous  singing voice Millie Bobby Brown was on  a BBC miniseries called intruders Finn  Wolford had also been in a TV show  called supernatural it's hard to imagine  what stranger things would have been  like with less experienced actors  particularly for the role of 11 that  role would have been hard to pull off  for a newbie casting director Carmen  Cuba said that they always knew it was  ambitious to expect that they would find  kids that were going to be able to pull  these roles off it seems they found the  perfect cast for the show  Elevens escaped in early drafts of the  stranger things pilot 11 unleashed her  powers very early in the story she used  her telekinetic powers to free herself  from the lab and it was intense but  instead the duffer brothers decided to  tease it out for a bit and surprise  audiences with how powerful 11 actually  i